{"summary":"Become best friends with a lonely bird.","description":"* Experience the Google Indie Game Festival winner *\n\n◆ Become best friends with the loneliest bird in the world ◆\n\nA journey of growth and loss with a best friend.\nTalk about life, make music, draw pictures and write poetry.\n\nStart each day answering your new friend's questions about life, death and the meaning of existence. \n\nGuide the bird through daily life as it confronts the same worries as the rest of us.\n\n◆ What's your favourite colour?\n◆ Where are all my friends?\n◆ Do you ever think about death?\n\nWhat will your best friend ask you today?\n\n◆ Draw a picture for the Art Gallery\n◆ Write a poem together for the Book of Poetry\n◆ Unlock today's plant for the Musical Garden\n◆ Rub its belly\n\nWatch each day turn to night\nPonder the changing seasons\nFace the heaviness of growing old with a best friend.\n\nMaybe this bird won't be so lonely after all.\n\n◆\n\nContent warning: Bird Alone contains themes and discussion of death. User discretion is advised for those sensitive to this topic.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$2.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/s84dppSpED4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mAeG0E_vZnuMJTVzYUa_Xa4mR7Og2TR5SNxFffQJ5GFSJ3DsZsVXfFX1G1ysK9QzyH4BpTbG-EyZ8azDzWlfycA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nV89HZJemolVCla5hTl1N0PQQKkzvXvFM86h8FuHO8fnYrtmLmjaYbS26h9Zx7eppZqvRpFhV9FcKztzORQJ1Ys","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FFJEhSu7gKNMat-vBXJQGt3_pImtgS7re95sLwnVFbgKWRvLR643cqh7Yu9_7iAs283g23Ut1JZRQgrD2EKotw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NCqEmJvzu3bD-7wiZ83anrhYdGB7X5Uh8b28r2KAzexVm65Df8vR0QIEmQWI1JpfLmH--7Rp05H2cpliisxKyb0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/60KqNq0BoxXRf3huLosHXJssDXEFB4OWb-P2HE3J0r8ZtByXLRFtu-zjIi-zNrwsVR5KSoG92zPK1Y_BKfLPcDo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QoyyBeTaTBaV0f2uiGm8kgdEG8nL50bsdozI32gGsQu5s1ngsvfnP